        "original_id": "b073f546-ac17-59c8-a27d-6f0ca4ffd1d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roger Miller, Patti Page, O. C. Smith\n- Songs: \"Little Green Apples\"\n- Awards: Grammy Award for Best Country Song\n- Charts: Billboard Hot 100, UK Singles Chart\n\nFacts:\n- The Grammy Award for Best Country Song has been awarded since 1965.\n- In 1968, O. C. Smith's recording of \"Little Green Apples\" reached No. 2 on the Billboard Hot 100 and sold over one million records.\n- Roger Miller's version of \"Little Green Apples\" became a Top 40 hit on the Billboard Hot 100 and the UK Singles Chart.\n- Patti Page's version of \"Little Green Apples\" became her last entry on the Billboard Hot 100.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
